Kartograph

The kartograph-explore skill is adapted (not copied 1:1) from two skills of the
Superpowers project (https://github.com/obra/superpowers): its brainstorming skill
(opening an idea up before any solution is discussed) and the converging, one-question-
at-a-time interview style. It also borrows the "grill me" idea from mattpocock/skills
(https://github.com/mattpocock/skills) under its license.
